-45851c1a1725", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "ocr.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Llamaindex-academic-rag-chatbot\\data\\Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u1ecdc v\u1ee5\\ocr.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 765917, "creation_date": "2026-10-15", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-15"}, "hash": "d219485fea95a0baf2e61acae3d2caa1d534e1d1d8ea37486d1583a660db900e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "5b5217d6-517c-4f41-a5d6-08096e8bfc64", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f6403064aa3735828f2494b8c7878063c4f65af74a8712283fc5de529fe0ae74", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "UY BAN NHAN DAN CONG HOA XA HOI CHU NGHIA VIET NAM \nTHANH PHO HO CHI MINH Doc lap \u2014Ty do \u2014Hanh phic TRUONG DAI HOC SAI GON re \nS\u00e9: 3485 /QD-DHSG Thanh ph\u00e9 H6 Chi Minh, ngay|4 thang 41 ndm 2025 \nQUYET BINH \nV\u00e9 vi\u00e9c sira d\u00e9i, bd sung mot so di\u00e9u cita Quy ch\u00e9 dao tao \ntrinh d6 dai hoc Truong Dai hoc Sai Gon ban hanh k\u00e9m theo Quy\u00e9t dinh \ns0 258/QD-DHSG ngay 22/02/2022 cua Hi\u00e9u trong Tru\u00e9ng Dai hoc Sai Gon \nHIEU TRUONG TRUONG DAI HOC SAI GON \nCan cit Quy\u00e9t dinh s\u00e9 478/QD-TTg ngay 25/4/2007 cua Thi tu\u00e9ng Chinh phi \nv\u00e9 vi\u00e9e thanh lap Truong Dai hoc Sai Gon; \nCan ctr Quy\u00e9t dinh s\u00e9 4] 2/QD-UBND ngay 07/11/2025 cia Chit tich Uy ban nh\u00e9n \ndan Thanh pho H6\u00e9 Chi Minh v\u00e9 vi\u00e9c cong nh\u00e9n Hi\u00e9u truong Truong Dai hoc Sai Gon; \nCan ctr Thong tw s6 08/2021/TT-BGDDPT ngay 18/3/2021 cia B6 tru\u00e9ng B\u00e9 Gido \nduc va Dao tao v\u00e9 vi\u00e9c ban hanh Quy ch\u00e9 dao tao trinh do dai hoc; \nCan ck Quy\u00e9t dinh s6 258/OD-DHSG ngay 22/02/2022 ctia Hi\u00e9u tru\u00e9ng Truong \nDai hoc Sai Gon ban hanh Quy ch\u00e9 dao tao trinh d6 dai hoc Truong Dai hoc Sai Gon; \nTheo d\u00e9 nghi cia Trudng Phong D\u00e9do tao. \nQUYET DINH: \nDi\u00e9u 1. Sita ddi, bd sung mot s\u00e9 di\u00e9u cha Quy ch\u00e9 dao tao trinh d\u00e9 dai hoc \nTru\u00e9ng Dai hoc Sai Gon ban hanh k\u00e9m theo Quy\u00e9t dinh s\u00e9 258/QD-DHSG ngay \n22/02/2022 cha Hi\u00e9u tru\u00e9ng Truong Dai hoc Sai Gon, cu th\u00e9 nhu sau. \n1. Stra d\u00e9i, b\u00e9 sung khodn 2 Di\u00e9u 6: \n\u201c2. K\u00e9 hoach nam hoc th\u00e9 hi\u00e9n nhiing m\u00e9c thoi gian chinh ctia cdc hoat d\u00e9ng dao \ntao trong nam hoc, duge cong b\u00e9 kip thoi t\u00e9i cdc b\u00e9n li\u00e9n quan tru\u00e9c khi bat dau nam \nhoc; m\u00e9i nam hoc c\u00e9 02 d\u00e9n 03 hoc ki chinh v\u00e9i ting s\u00e9 t6i thi\u00e9u 30 tudn l\u00e9n I6p va 01 \nhoc ki phu (n\u00e9u c6) v\u00e9i t\u00e9i thi\u00e9u 05 tuan l\u00e9n l\u00e9p.\u201d. \n2.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1638, "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "5b5217d6-517c-4f41-a5d6-08096e8bfc64": {"__data__": {"id_": "5b5217d6-517c-4f41-a5d6-08096e8bfc64", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "ocr.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Llamaindex-academic-rag-chatbot\\data\\Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u1ecdc v\u1ee5\\ocr.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 765917, "creation_date": "2026-10-15", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-15", "document_title": "Qui ch\u1ebf \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc t\u1ea1i Tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0110\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc S\u00e0i G\u00f2n - \u0110i\u1ec1u 2 v\u00e0 \u0110i\u1ec1u 4", "folder_name": "Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u1ecdc v\u1ee5"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "428634ed-e651-4953-82a0-45851c1a1725", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "1