 Di\u00e9u 9: \n\u201cd. M\u00e9t s\u00e9 trong hop dac bi\u00e9t str dung cac di\u00e9m chit d\u00e9 x\u00e9p loai va khong duge \ntinh vao di\u00e9m trung binh hoc tap: \nH: Di\u00e9m chua hoan thi\u00e9n.do duge ph\u00e9p hoan thi, ki\u00e9m tra; \n_X: Di\u00e9m cha hoan thi\u00e9n do chua di dir ligu; \nM: Di\u00e9m hoc phan dugc mi\u00e9n hoc va c\u00e9ng nhan tin chi; \nR: Di\u00e9m hoc phan do sinh vi\u00e9n rit hoc phan.\u201d\n5. Stra d\u00e9i, bd sung khoan 2 Di\u00e9u 10: \n\u201c2 D\u00e9 tinh di\u00e9m trung binh, di\u00e9m chit cha hoc phan phai duge quy d\u00e9i v\u00e9 di\u00e9m s\u00e9 \nnhu dudi day: \nA quy d\u00e9i thanh 4,0; \nB+ quy d\u00e9i thanh 3,5; \nB quy d\u00e9i thanh 3,0; \nC+ quy d\u00e9i thanh 2,5; \nC quy d\u00e9i thanh 2,0; \nD+ quy d6i thanh 1,5; \nD quy d\u00e9i thanh 1,0; \nF quy d\u00e9i thanh 0\u201d. | \nDi\u00e9u 2. Quy\u00e9t dinh nay c\u00e9 hi\u00e9u luc k\u00e9 tir ngay ky. Khoan 3, 4, 5 Di\u00e9u 1 4p dung \nd\u00e9i v\u00e9i cdc khda tuy\u00e9n sinh tir nam 2025 tr\u00e9 di.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1278, "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "4efa5df2-4de5-4f9e-bd7b-4dad5e0150b5": {"__data__": {"id_": "4efa5df2-4de5-4f9e-bd7b-4dad5e0150b5", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "3", "file_name": "ocr.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Llamaindex-academic-rag-chatbot\\data\\Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u1ecdc v\u1ee5\\ocr.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 765917, "creation_date": "2026-10-15", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-15", "document_title": "Ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng, Quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ph\u00f2ng \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o, ph\u00f2ng gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c, th\u1ee7 tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1c khoa v\u00e0 tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb li\u00ean quan trong vi\u1ec7c thi h\u00e0nh quy ch\u1ebf h\u1ecdc v\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc t\u1ea1i S\u